      505.99,
      539.67,
      638.7
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land/lands on which a servitude is to be acquired are hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before me at the Divisional Secretariat, at Mahara, on the 10th August 2017 at 10.00 a.m. and hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 3rd August 2017, the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land/Servitude the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.",
